{"id":"458017","name":"五指毛桃瘦肉汤","author":"羅師奶","authorId":"11178197","desc":"","cover":"images/458017/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五指毛桃","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪展","amount":"1个"},{"name":"莲子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"百合","amount":"1兩"},{"name":"淮山","amount":"8块"},{"name":"玉竹","amount":"2块"}],"sub":[{"name":"陈皮","amount":"1块"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五指毛桃洗干淨，浸泡20分钟备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155758314623111178197.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗其他中藥材料，可浸泡20分钟，將水隔去;瘦肉氽水备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155758327157211178197.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"煲内注入适量清水，放陈皮先煲滾。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155758338530711178197.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"將所有材料放入煲内，大火煲滾15分钟后，转中小火煲1小時，加少許盐調味即成。","img":""}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}